info
# Issue #1967: a closed local-backend issue stopped counting as an open
# blocker because ``git cherry`` proved every patch on its worker branch
# already landed on HEAD (rebase/cherry-pick landing -- the branch tip is
# not an ancestor of HEAD, but has no ``+`` commits). Info, not warning:
# the gate correctly recognising landed work is routine operation; the
# event exists so the un-blocking is auditable once per issue.
